/android/app/release

# SEC-17.3: Firebase config. It carries a Google API key, the project id/number,
# OAuth client ids and app-signing SHA-1s, and this repository is public. The app
# does not use Firebase - no google-services Gradle plugin is applied and Google
# Sign-In reads serverClientId from source - so nothing here should ever need it.
# If Firebase is genuinely adopted later, supply this file from the build
# environment rather than committing it.
android/app/google-services.json

# Accidentally-committed adb logcat capture (~70MB), tracked at HEAD since
# ac51e25. Contains device/app metadata including a personally-identifying
# Wi-Fi SSID. Root-scoped so it doesn't hide a legitimately-named crash.txt
# elsewhere in the tree.
/crash.txt
